  <title id="score-present-title">Present score — a row of five slide frames stepping upward, each holding one mark, joined by a single narrative line that rises to a larger mark in the final frame, with tick marks at the perimeter and a dot grid field beneath. A sequence of frames, each holding one mark, building to a single point.</title>
